 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Good to have something new. The history of a war is fascinating. Would you rather start from the beginning of a war, or at a specific moment? Then the history of Rome has three great sections. The fall of the republic, the civil wars, and the golden age of the empire. The republic is quite dry, but the civil wars have some great battles. Would you start there? Okay. The republic is about two hours and the civil wars are two hours as well. Nice. Listen while you're waiting in the car park or cleaning the house.",
